guides=[('specification','Start with the specification','Write down your requirements before comparing products.','List the intended department, available space, dimensions, quantities, power requirements and existing equipment connections. Ask the supplier to confirm the exact configuration and included accessories before placing an order.'),('quotation','Read a quotation with confidence','Compare the full scope of supply, not just the headline amount.','Request an itemised quotation covering the product configuration, accessories, applicable taxes, transport, installation and any training. Confirm lead times, payment milestones, return terms and warranty coverage in writing.'),('facility','Build a facility equipment list','Keep your procurement list clear and easy to review.','Group requirements by room or department, assign quantities and identify any space or utility constraints. Have your clinical and engineering teams review compatibility and installation needs. Keep delivery and acceptance requirements with each line item.')]
